      {
        "id": 195456,
        "name": "Bigbywolfe",
        "username": "Bigbywolfe",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/dbc845/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2017-04-14T01:03:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"just.a.smith\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/dec6dc/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> just.a.smith:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>This is a fixed start, right?  Maybe I just got lucky with what I searched for and got favorable shuffles.  I used both copies of Expatriettes card that searches for Pride or Prejudice on the first turn, iirc.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I did too, and never got any ammo. Got all 3 submachine guns though…</p>",
