      {
        "id": 195457,
        "name": "deddragon",
        "username": "deddragon",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/deddragon/{size}/2335_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-04-14T04:44:12.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Even with fixed start, there is a lot in this setup that can change the way things play out.  Whether you search out Pride or Prejudice first affects the RNG I’m sure.  Likewise how/if Unity uses Flash Forge.<br>\nNightmist can shuffle a trash into a deck at pretty much any time she wants.  Wrecking Uppercut used at the right time, or not at all. The number of powers each hero uses (thus discarding 5 off the top.)<br>\nIt’s a good go-round. I like it.</p>",
