        "created_at": "2017-04-14T07:05:49.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Mint by the skin of my teeth. Nightmist at 7 hp, everyone else incapacitated.  Almost lost due to an unexpected True Form from the environment knocking me her down so that after the Villain turn she was at 1hp.</p>",
