      {
        "id": 195459,
        "name": "bolnerap",
        "username": "bolnerap",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bolnerap/{size}/6056_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-04-14T14:00:35.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Mint, Nightmist at 20, everyone else incapped. KNYFE and Unity both did some good work, Expat didn't get to do a whole lot except use a Hastily Augmented Shotgun for 6 and keep cycling stuff into play so the others could stay set up. I never saw a single ammo card. Would have been nice to have Liquid N2 Rounds but I ended up not needing them.</p><p>Wrecking Uppercut helped me get to the flip faster, and once he flipped, I cut loose with two Overdo It powered KNYFE turns and one big Unity turn. Volatile Parts helped knock him down a bit as well. I chose order poorly on the last Apprentice Poisoner I saw, but it only cost me 1 HP on him and it didn't matter - Nightmist was over 20 when everyone else went down, and Spite was already down to 14, so the environment was all over him and not me.</p><p>I think I'll give this another whirl for laughs later to see if I can do a little better.</p>",
        "post_number": 25,
