      {
        "id": 195460,
        "name": "jesse_garcia_87",
        "username": "jesse_garcia_87",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jesse_garcia_87/{size}/2102_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-04-14T17:45:27.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Minted.</p><p>bit of a tough fight, but i survived with everyone still alive. the Liquid Nitro rounds did help, but mostly it was use everyone to buffer and survive, and get every possible 'bot out as soon as possible. ALMOST got Spite down before he flipped, Turret Bot did amazingly at ticking Spite's armour off, to let the Raptors and Platform 'bots knock him around.&nbsp;</p><p>was a good and actually entertainning fight.</p>",
