        "created_at": "2017-04-17T21:04:48.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yeah, fixed start just means the game's random seed is predetermined for setup purposes. &nbsp;As soon as you shuffle a deck for any reason, that deck isn't fixed anymore. &nbsp;I neither drew nor milled any ammo until after Spite flipped.</p>",
